  "headline": "FDA shortage list shows Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC neostigmine methylsulfate injection to be discontinued as of 2026-01-12; Hikma label lists a plant last inspected NAI 2026-05-13",
  "headline_cites": ["E11", "E10"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list records Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC neostigmine methylsulfate injection as To Be Discontinued with an initial posting date of 2026-01-12.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The listed reason is discontinuation of the manufacture of the drug.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A current product label names Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. as the labeler and manufacturer at FEI 2220525.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That plant's most recent inspection classification in FDA's records is NAI dated 2026-05-13.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earlier inspections of the same plant from 2009 through 2024 were classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 15 days on hand and Corvale General has 28 days on hand at current usage rates.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Check whether Hikma's supply can cover the gap left by Fresenius Kabi's discontinuation and confirm Amneal Pharmaceuticals LLC availability as the rule-suggested alternative.",
      "cites": ["E10", "E11"]
    }
  ]
}
